  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Scusa, Allenat<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿ̂orrice, posso chiederti un favore?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 8,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00530063007500730061002C00200041006C006C0065006E0061007400100003110000FF0302006F00720072006900630065002C00200070006F00730073006F002000630068006900650064006500720074006900200075006E0020006600610076006F00720065003F00100002011401A60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vorrei che consegnassi questa lettera alla preside\ndell’Istituto Étoile.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Non posso consegnargliela di persona per motivi\nche non posso svelare...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Potresti farmi questo favore? Consegneresti\nla lettera per me?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006F0074007200650073007400690020006600610072006D0069002000710075006500730074006F0020006600610076006F00720065003F00200043006F006E007300650067006E006500720065007300740069000A006C00610020006C00650074007400650072006100200070006500720020006D0065003F00100002011401A60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Va bene",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00560061002000620065006E00650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La cosa mi puzza...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006100200063006F007300610020006D0069002000700075007A007A0061002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Se hai dei sospetti, perché non accetti l’incarico\nper scoprire direttamente di che si tratta?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Merci! Lo sapevo, hai proprio la faccia di\nuna persona ben disposta.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D006500720063006900210020004C006F002000730061007000650076006F002C0020006800610069002000700072006F007000720069006F0020006C00610020006600610063006300690061002000640069000A0075006E006100200070006500720073006F006E0061002000620065006E00200064006900730070006F007300740061002E00100002011401A60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Questa è la lettera che dovresti consegnare.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005100750065007300740061002000E80020006C00610020006C006500740074006500720061002000630068006500200064006F00760072006500730074006900200063006F006E007300650067006E006100720065002E00100002011401A60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Devi darla alla preside dell’<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Istituto Étoile<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>,\nmi raccomando!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00440065007600690020006400610072006C006100200061006C006C006100200070007200650073006900640065002000640065006C006C201900100002FF0000060049007300740069007400750074006F002000C90074006F0069006C006500100002FF000000002C000A006D006900200072006100630063006F006D0061006E0064006F002100100002011401A60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, io ti conosco...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nGrazie di cuore per aver ritrovato il mio anello,\nsei stat<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa molto cortese.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 109
    },
    {
      "displayText": "A proposito, qual buon vento ti porta qui oggi\nall’Istituto Étoile?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041002000700072006F0070006F007300690074006F002C0020007100750061006C002000620075006F006E002000760065006E0074006F00200074006900200070006F00720074006100200071007500690020006F006700670069000A0061006C006C20190049007300740069007400750074006F002000C90074006F0069006C0065003F00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sto cercando la preside",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 8,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00530074006F002000630065007200630061006E0064006F0020006C0061002000700072006500730069006400650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Devo consegnare una lettera",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004400650076006F00200063006F006E007300650067006E00610072006500200075006E00610020006C0065007400740065007200610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La preside dell’Istituto Étoile sono io.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006100200070007200650073006900640065002000640065006C006C20190049007300740069007400750074006F002000C90074006F0069006C006500200073006F006E006F00200069006F002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hai consegnato la Lettera importante a Moira!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00480061006900200063006F006E007300650067006E00610074006F0020006C00610020004C00650074007400650072006100200069006D0070006F007200740061006E00740065002000610020004D006F00690072006100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Chi ti ha dato questa lettera?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006800690020007400690020006800610020006400610074006F00200071007500650073007400610020006C006500740074006500720061003F00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Anzi... Prima vorrei verificare una cosa.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006E007A0069002E002E002E0020005000720069006D006100200076006F00720072006500690020007600650072006900660069006300610072006500200075006E006100200063006F00730061002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Potresti recarti alle <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Costruzioni Racines<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>,\nnel 6º isolato?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006F0074007200650073007400690020007200650063006100720074006900200061006C006C0065002000100002FF0000060043006F0073007400720075007A0069006F006E006900200052006100630069006E0065007300100002FF000000002C000A006E0065006C0020003600BA002000690073006F006C00610074006F003F00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Grazie per essere venut<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004700720061007A0069006500200070006500720020006500730073006500720065002000760065006E0075007400100003110000FF0101006F0061002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ti ringrazio di esserti recat<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa qui appositamente.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540069002000720069006E006700720061007A0069006F0020006400690020006500730073006500720074006900200072006500630061007400100003110000FF0101006F006100200071007500690020006100700070006F0073006900740061006D0065006E00740065002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "In verità avrei dovuto verificare per conto mio, ma\nil contenuto della lettera mi lascia perplessa...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nTi riferisco cosa c’è scritto.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 140
    },
    {
      "displayText": "\"Perdonami per essermene andato senza averti\ndetto una cosa importante.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n14 anni fa, chiesi a un uomo di aggiustare\nquell’anello a cui tenevo tanto.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSi chiama Tarragon, è il proprietario delle\nCostruzioni Racines.\"<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 224
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Non avrei mai pensato di ricevere una lettera\nda parte del mio defunto marito...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nÈ per questo che avevo paura di recarmi qui\nda sola.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 141
    },
    {
      "displayText": "È lei il signor Tarragon?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00C80020006C0065006900200069006C0020007300690067006E006F00720020005400610072007200610067006F006E003F00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sì, cosa posso fare per lei?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300EC002C00200063006F0073006100200070006F00730073006F0020006600610072006500200070006500720020006C00650069003F00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Per caso un uomo le lasciò un anello da riparare,\n14 anni fa?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 4016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006500720020006300610073006F00200075006E00200075006F006D006F0020006C00650020006C006100730063006900F200200075006E00200061006E0065006C006C006F002000640061002000720069007000610072006100720065002C000A0031003400200061006E006E0069002000660061003F00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ebbene sì.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 4148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006200620065006E00650020007300EC002E00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quel giorno ero al ristorante per festeggiare\nil compleanno di Canary.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ci mettemmo a chiacchierare con un uomo\nseduto al tavolo accanto, un tipo simpatico.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quando seppe che lavoro facevo, mi chiese\nd’incastonare di nuovo la pietra di un suo anello.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Disse che era il suo anello di fidanzamento e che\nci teneva molto, poiché la moglie ne aveva<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nuno uguale.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 112
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quell’uomo era mio marito, ma poco tempo dopo\nebbe un incidente, e...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005100750065006C006C20190075006F006D006F00200065007200610020006D0069006F0020006D0061007200690074006F002C0020006D006100200070006F0063006F002000740065006D0070006F00200064006F0070006F000A006500620062006500200075006E00200069006E0063006900640065006E00740065002C00200065002E002E002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Le mie condoglianze...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 5080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C00650020006D0069006500200063006F006E0064006F0067006C00690061006E007A0065002E002E002E00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Che strano, però, che lei venga a trovarmi dopo\ntutto questo tempo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 5136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00430068006500200073007400720061006E006F002C002000700065007200F2002C00200063006800650020006C00650069002000760065006E0067006100200061002000740072006F007600610072006D006900200064006F0070006F000A0074007500740074006F002000710075006500730074006F002000740065006D0070006F002E00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Volevo pagarla per la riparazione.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 5280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006F006C00650076006F002000700061006700610072006C006100200070006500720020006C00610020007200690070006100720061007A0069006F006E0065002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Solo un momento, madame.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 5360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006F006C006F00200075006E0020006D006F006D0065006E0074006F002C0020006D006100640061006D0065002E00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Come compenso per la riparazione... gradirei una\nlotta di Pokémon. Ci pensi tu, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 5420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "T’aspetto in garage. Passa di lì, quando te la senti!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 5600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00542019006100730070006500740074006F00200069006E0020006700610072006100670065002E0020005000610073007300610020006400690020006C00EC002C0020007100750061006E0064006F0020007400650020006C0061002000730065006E00740069002100100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>Pare che io ti debba un altro favore,\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 5716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BD0600000050006100720065002000630068006500200069006F00200074006900200064006500620062006100200075006E00200061006C00740072006F0020006600610076006F00720065002C000A0010000201000000002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿*",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 5820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF002A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oltre a preparare il pane, mastro Gris mi sta\ninsegnando anche a lottare con i Pokémon!<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nOra ti mostrerò i miei progressi!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 5832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 129
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sarò io a vincere!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 6092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00530061007200F200200069006F00200061002000760069006E006300650072006500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Un momento...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 6132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0055006E0020006D006F006D0065006E0074006F002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Non posso darti quell’anello finché non\nm’affronti.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 6160,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F006E00200070006F00730073006F0020006400610072007400690020007100750065006C006C20190061006E0065006C006C006F002000660069006E0063006800E90020006E006F006E000A006D20190061006600660072006F006E00740069002E00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Allora pronti, via con la lotta!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 6272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C006C006F00720061002000700072006F006E00740069002C002000760069006100200063006F006E0020006C00610020006C006F007400740061002100100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿0",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 6348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Excadrill! Excadrill!! Excadrill!!! Trapana\nl’avversario con la tua enorme trivella!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 6360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿2",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 6532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00320000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "E ti pareva! Ma Excadrill e io siamo migliorati, no?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nTu hai fatto molto per me, quindi diventare più\nforte è il mio modo per ripagarti.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 6544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 143
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Madame, io ho ricevuto il mio compenso, quindi\nrestituisco l’anello.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 6832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D006100640061006D0065002C00200069006F00200068006F00200072006900630065007600750074006F00200069006C0020006D0069006F00200063006F006D00700065006E0073006F002C0020007100750069006E00640069000A0072006500730074006900740075006900730063006F0020006C20190061006E0065006C006C006F002E00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 6980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hai consegnato l’Anello prezioso!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 7000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00480061006900200063006F006E007300650067006E00610074006F0020006C20190041006E0065006C006C006F0020007000720065007A0069006F0073006F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Prima ho perso mio marito, e successivamente\nanche il mio anello...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nMa adesso sono di nuovo riuniti. Li custodirò con\ncura, insieme ai ricordi a loro legati.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 7068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 165
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ti ringrazio dal profondo del cuore per aver\nritrovato non solo il mio anello, ma anche<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nquello del mio amato.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 7400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 117
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Anch’io son più sereno, ora che quell’anello è\nfinalmente tornato al legittimo proprietario!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 7636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿:",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 7832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF003A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ho fatto un bel sogno, sai?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nHo sognato di chiacchierare con mio marito,\nil giorno in cui mi regalò quell’anello...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 7844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
